            <note corresp="#d508-f3" n="15" xml:id="d508-f3-content">
                <p>Shipment of arms and ammunition was made on Nov. 8, 1921, via the S.S. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Colombia</hi> of the Pacific Mail Steamship Co.</p>
            </note>
